      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِثْرٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَثَرٌ</span>, in three places: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَثْرٌ</span>: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  and
see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آثِرٌ</span>, in two places. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also, (S, M, K,) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُثْرٌ</span></b> , (M, K,) but the latter is disallowed by more
than one authority, (TA,) <i>What is termed the</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُلَاصَة</span>[q. v.] <i>of clarified butter:</i> (S, M, K:) or,
as some say, the <i>milk when the clarified butter
has become separated from it.</i> (M.) [See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِشْدَةٌ</span>.]

